```python
#⚙ Installation & Run 

# 1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/bhagya21-tech/student-mental-health-dashboard.git
cd student-mental-health-dashboard

# 2. Create virtual environment 

python -m venv venv 
venv\Scripts\activate 

# 3. Install dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

# 4. Run the app 

streamlit run app.py

``` 

---
🔍 Key Insights 

* Higher daily social media usage is associated with lower mental health scores 
* Students in high-risk mental health groups tend to sleep less
* Certain platforms show higher average addiction scores
* Mental health risk varies significantly across student groups

